      "content": "is it really that black and white though? it feels like if we just keep cutting people every time a new tool comes out, we're eventually gonna lose the human intuition that actually makes the company special. don't you think there's a more sustainable way to look at this than just treating people like an inefficiency to be trimmed away?",
